  Tournament, match, team, and player data may be fetched at runtime via the
  PandaScore API when you supply your own PANDASCORE_API_TOKEN.
  Redistribution of PandaScore data and assets is governed by PandaScore's
  terms of service, not by this project's Apache-2.0 license.
  Bring your own API key and comply with https://pandascore.co/ terms.

Cloudflare Images
  Uploaded and CDN-hosted images may be served via Cloudflare Images when
  CLOUDFLARE_* credentials are configured. Usage is subject to Cloudflare's
  terms. This repository does not redistribute Cloudflare-hosted media.

